## 🔍 Key Insights  
- Most staff fall within the **intermediate** digital literacy level.  
- There are clear gaps in **software proficiency** and **online collaboration tools**.  
- Internet connectivity remains a major challenge.  
- Many staff are open to digital training if properly supported.

---

## 🧭 Recommendations  
- Develop structured digital literacy training programs.  
- Improve access to laptops and stable connectivity.  
- Adopt digital tools with user-friendly onboarding.  
- Provide continuous support and refresher sessions.

